{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The roar of a lion</b> — נהם ככפיר. <b>Who provokes him</b> — מתעברו, [meaning] מתעבר עמו. <b>His soul is the one who sins</b>, because he does not give honor to the kingdom."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:44.918880797Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}